#, no-wrap
msgid "We now construct the feature map that embeds our classical dataset into a higher-dimensional feature space. For this embedding, we use the [``ZZFeatureMap``](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ZZFeatureMap) from Qiskit.\n"
